; Fan coil rows. Physical boundary (MyHOME fixture f461_live_2026-10-15,
; run3_climate, F461 2.0.11 + KW4691 + F430/2 as 2#1 + F430/4 as 2#2): the
; cooling demand *#4*2*#14*0230*2## below 24.1 (t=137.4..140.4) was captured on
; the discrete 3-relay F430/4 with the speed automatic (11*0), where the KW4691
; PI loop drove speed 3 (*#4*2#2*20*8##, *#4*2*19*8*0##); the 20*9 the virtual
; fan coil reports for the automatic speed is the modulating status byte 0x2F
; bt_termo decodes (ownkb:claim:c003281), not a value that bench produced.
; *#4*2*#11*1..3,0## (t=324.972..336.783) were ACKed, echoed as *#4*2*11*S## and
; persisted by the physical KW4691 with the zone OFF; a #11 write while 2#2 was
; running was not exercised live, so the running fan coil following the written
; speed is clean-room, as is the generic write under cooling demand keeping the
; fan coil.
