; Season switch and OFF. Physical boundary (f461_live_2026-10-15): the switch
; to heating with the cooling fan coil running released it to 20*5
; (probe_followup t=80.437..82.905), the switch to cooling with the heating
; valve on released it to 20*0 / 19*5*0 (probe_fancoil t=9.446..16.536), so the
; heating demand here releases 2#2 before 2#1 switches on; *4*303*2## was sent
; while 2#2 ran (20*8, run3_climate t=163.537), the F461 ACKed and emitted
; *4*303*2##, *#4*2*12*0230*3##, *4*303*2##, *#4*2*0*0241##, and 2.8 s later the
; KW4691 released 2#2 to 20*5 (t=166.446); here OFF releases the valve the
; heating demand switched on. The central form *4*303*#2## left the standalone
; zone unchanged (2026-10-26). Then back to the fixture state: manual heating
; 24.5, fan speed automatic.
